    {
     "index": 0,
     "startSeconds": 0.0,
     "endSeconds": 25.2,
     "textPreview": "想象一下这个画面凌晨两点呃你一个人坐在实验室或者宿舍的电脑前屏幕上还散发着仿真软",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 1,
     "startSeconds": 25.2,
     "endSeconds": 50.24,
     "textPreview": "后你下意识的双击了增益模块把那个K的数值从五改成了十点击运行对结果示波器里的曲线",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 2,
     "startSeconds": 50.24,
     "endSeconds": 75.48,
     "textPreview": "祈祷着能瞎猫碰上死耗子呃蒙出一个刚好能及格的波形这个绝望的调参画面你们是不是觉得",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 3,
     "startSeconds": 75.48,
     "endSeconds": 100.6,
     "textPreview": "经历过绝对的谁没被SMElink折磨过呢对这就是典型的无头苍蝇式工程设计也是我们",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 4,
     "startSeconds": 100.6,
     "endSeconds": 125.6,
     "textPreview": "心我们今天的核心任务呢只有一个带领你们跨越一道鸿沟也就是呃如何把你们脑子里固有的",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 5,
     "startSeconds": 125.6,
     "endSeconds": 150.64,
     "textPreview": "们学这门课绝对不仅仅是为了在期末转子上拿个学分更是为了在未来成为一名真正合格的不",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 6,
     "startSeconds": 150.64,
     "endSeconds": 175.72,
     "textPreview": "越到底卡在哪里了住之前你必须先用白纸黑字写清楚硬约束软目标和观察指标对如果不先把",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 7,
     "startSeconds": 175.72,
     "endSeconds": 200.84,
     "textPreview": "什么哇这句话切中的正是大家在做大作业时最容易犯的战略性错误怎么说在之前的模块里大",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-9cd2a9dfb0f7f3d457247609",
       "matchedLabel": "调节时间",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      },
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-df3167f36376f526f6ec5562",
       "matchedLabel": "超调量",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 12,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 8,
     "startSeconds": 200.84,
     "endSeconds": 225.92,
     "textPreview": "行没错但在真实的工程设计中我们面对的是一个完全开放式的结局所有的性能指标都很重要",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-object-10c37fd947ba55593ff03ede",
       "matchedLabel": "性能指标",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 9,
     "startSeconds": 225.92,
     "endSeconds": 251.04,
     "textPreview": "生的例子吧这就好比我们去买奶茶奶茶这个比喻有点儿意思对呀你走到柜台前绝不可能只对",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 10,
     "startSeconds": 251.04,
     "endSeconds": 276.28,
     "textPreview": "给出这个确切的边界店员根本没法儿动手回到控制系统上我们在仿真算法里疯狂试错那个K",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 11,
     "startSeconds": 276.28,
     "endSeconds": 301.48,
     "textPreview": "楚要求大不了做出一杯难喝的奶茶但在控制工程里如果你不明确边界就盲目转动增益旋钮就",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 12,
     "startSeconds": 301.48,
     "endSeconds": 326.68,
     "textPreview": "的地在哪门都没定义跑的再快也只是在原地打转甚至可能会冲下悬崖哎呦冲下悬崖就太可怕",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 13,
     "startSeconds": 326.68,
     "endSeconds": 352.08,
     "textPreview": "实说光看这些指标就足够让人眼花缭乱了时域里有时域的规矩什么上升时间t二啊峰值时间",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-8d214840417a4c3b5780c715",
       "matchedLabel": "稳态误差",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      },
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-9cd2a9dfb0f7f3d457247609",
       "matchedLabel": "调节时间",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      },
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-a9f8ff29f0e4550a22bfcc67",
       "matchedLabel": "上升时间",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 14,
     "startSeconds": 352.08,
     "endSeconds": 377.12,
     "textPreview": "框停率欧米伽B甚至为了看整体表现还搞出了什么ISEIAEITAE这一堆误差积分指",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 15,
     "startSeconds": 377.6,
     "endSeconds": 402.92,
     "textPreview": "我的第一直觉肯定是噢我能不能把所有的属性点全部加满典型的玩家思维是啊我想要系统反",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-8d214840417a4c3b5780c715",
       "matchedLabel": "稳态误差",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 16,
     "startSeconds": 403.08,
     "endSeconds": 428.12,
     "textPreview": "物理世界里既要又要还要是最大的笑话啊真的一点儿商量的余地都没有吗没有速度和稳定性",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 17,
     "startSeconds": 428.12,
     "endSeconds": 453.12,
     "textPreview": "号的跟随能力越强动作就越迅猛动作迅猛不是好事而吗天下武功唯快不破啊问题在于物理系",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 18,
     "startSeconds": 453.12,
     "endSeconds": 478.4,
     "textPreview": "项为欲赌干嘛当你盲目推高欧米伽C来追求数时如果不改变系统的本质结构系统的相位滞后",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 19,
     "startSeconds": 478.4,
     "endSeconds": 503.4,
     "textPreview": "严重的超调甚至开始来回振这在工程上是毁灭性的嗯我懂了所以这就像是冬天盖了一张太小",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 20,
     "startSeconds": 503.4,
     "endSeconds": 528.44,
     "textPreview": "少系统还是稳定的在控制系统里如果你为了追求极快的响应拼命放大增益试图把这块小毯子",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-7734a0845c335f160395bac0",
       "matchedLabel": "数学模型",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": false,
       "score": 8,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 21,
     "startSeconds": 528.44,
     "endSeconds": 553.68,
     "textPreview": "崩溃设备可能直接烧毁或者机械结构断裂难怪难怪讲义里要专门弄出三个极的概念最大的那",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 22,
     "startSeconds": 553.68,
     "endSeconds": 578.72,
     "textPreview": "错而在满意域里我们才去谈什么最犹豫哦最犹豫包含于满意域满意域包含于可行域逻辑非常",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 23,
     "startSeconds": 578.72,
     "endSeconds": 605.0,
     "textPreview": "全区里做取舍这就是工程判断的灵魂好既然聊到了具体的取舍我们来看看讲义里给出的两个",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 24,
     "startSeconds": 605.0,
     "endSeconds": 630.12,
     "textPreview": "先性是舒适与储备优先第一任务是让动态过程进入乘客和系统能接受的区域再去讨论打方向",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-9cd2a9dfb0f7f3d457247609",
       "matchedLabel": "调节时间",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      },
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-df3167f36376f526f6ec5562",
       "matchedLabel": "超调量",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 12,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 25,
     "startSeconds": 630.12,
     "endSeconds": 655.24,
     "textPreview": "量高达惊人的3201帕天呐百分之三十二而且调节时间拖延到了8324秒更危险的是从",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-9cd2a9dfb0f7f3d457247609",
       "matchedLabel": "调节时间",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 26,
     "startSeconds": 655.24,
     "endSeconds": 680.48,
     "textPreview": "一下这个就像是你开的车载着极其容易晕车的奶去超市哈哈这个比喻很生动你的第一诉求绝",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 27,
     "startSeconds": 680.48,
     "endSeconds": 705.76,
     "textPreview": "汁都要吐在甲板上了绝对的所以在奶奶的胃口也就是平顺和储备边界面前速度必须五条进让",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-df3167f36376f526f6ec5562",
       "matchedLabel": "超调量",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 12,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 28,
     "startSeconds": 705.76,
     "endSeconds": 730.76,
     "textPreview": "且最要命的是时间约束没说它的调节时间TS被死死卡在零点二秒以内这就像是现在战斗机",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-9cd2a9dfb0f7f3d457247609",
       "matchedLabel": "调节时间",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 29,
     "startSeconds": 730.76,
     "endSeconds": 755.8,
     "textPreview": "先性是如何重塑系统的命的在案例B中我们需要极高的贷款这时候我们甚至愿意把系统逼近",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 30,
     "startSeconds": 755.8,
     "endSeconds": 780.88,
     "textPreview": "直觉肯定是呃超掉是因为冲的太猛了对吧嗯大部分人都会这么想那我直接把开环增益K调小",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 31,
     "startSeconds": 780.88,
     "endSeconds": 805.92,
     "textPreview": "移这看起来似乎能让系统温柔一点对啊呃曲线拉低了不就不那么猛烈了吗系统就温和了呀但",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 32,
     "startSeconds": 805.92,
     "endSeconds": 831.04,
     "textPreview": "变化几乎没有反应的迟钝木头对于一艘需要在复杂洋流和海风中保持航向的客船来说如果打",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 33,
     "startSeconds": 831.24,
     "endSeconds": 856.44,
     "textPreview": "交了没错我们设定的硬约数里ts要小于等于45秒你如果只降增亦调节时间可能会直接飙",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-9cd2a9dfb0f7f3d457247609",
       "matchedLabel": "调节时间",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 34,
     "startSeconds": 856.44,
     "endSeconds": 881.68,
     "textPreview": "断出病因37度的阈度对于有延时的物理系统来说太危险了既然增亦不能降我们就必须引入",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-object-f1df5739a34bf55489aeeeeb",
       "matchedLabel": "校正装置",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 35,
     "startSeconds": 881.92,
     "endSeconds": 907.2,
     "textPreview": "听起来有点违犯直觉啊系统的时间怎么可能超前呢难道能惯串越这里说的超前不是时间倒流",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 36,
     "startSeconds": 907.2,
     "endSeconds": 935.32,
     "textPreview": "前给出反向的控制信号在还没达到目标点之前就开始踩刹车哇预判了你的预判这样一来他在",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-df3167f36376f526f6ec5562",
       "matchedLabel": "超调量",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 12,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 37,
     "startSeconds": 935.64,
     "endSeconds": 961.08,
     "textPreview": "的边界以内哇原来公式里的微分和超前在物理世界里就是个会预判的导这个比喻很贴切听完",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 38,
     "startSeconds": 961.08,
     "endSeconds": 990.56,
     "textPreview": "十三开始起步调参最后一步四折四用实验结果检验断这个流程非常严密很多同学说这不就跟",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 39,
     "startSeconds": 991.44,
     "endSeconds": 1016.48,
     "textPreview": "然这个软件开发的类比很直观但在控制工程里我们要面对的现实要残酷的多怎么说软件出B",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 40,
     "startSeconds": 1016.48,
     "endSeconds": 1046.28,
     "textPreview": "环这怎么理你想想看如果在最后四至四的实验检验阶段你发现结果很糟糕各项指标死活达不",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 41,
     "startSeconds": 1046.44,
     "endSeconds": 1071.56,
     "textPreview": "试试运气对因为大家都觉得肯定是自己参数没调好难道不是吗这恰恰是最致命的狭隘视角如",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-44e603669ad0e6bf331b1511",
       "matchedLabel": "反馈回路",
       "labelKind": "alias",
       "inScope": false,
       "score": 4,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 42,
     "startSeconds": 1071.56,
     "endSeconds": 1100.0,
     "textPreview": "的系统硬件结构执行器功率是不是存在根本性的天花板偶小麻拉大车参数怎么调都没有用没",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 43,
     "startSeconds": 1100.0,
     "endSeconds": 1125.28,
     "textPreview": "至三里距微调参数把你的设计思维本身当做一个闭环系统来纠偏这才是顶级工程师的直觉太",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:domainconcept:fef4835248def04a043183ee",
       "matchedLabel": "闭环系统",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": false,
       "score": 8,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 44,
     "startSeconds": 1125.44,
     "endSeconds": 1155.0,
     "textPreview": "没错最后我们还把四步法还原成了一个审视工程师自新的闭环希望大家以后在面对那些杂乱",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 45,
     "startSeconds": 1155.0,
     "endSeconds": 1180.92,
     "textPreview": "是先停下来问问自己我的边界在哪里确实如此今天带你们看透的不仅是讲义上的枯燥公式更",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 46,
     "startSeconds": 1180.92,
     "endSeconds": 1210.0,
     "textPreview": "可以瞬间穷举千万种参数组合它甚至能在零点几秒内算出一个完美的ITA积分最优解算力",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 47,
     "startSeconds": 1210.0,
     "endSeconds": 1235.12,
     "textPreview": "没有想过像案例A中舒适与储备优先这种带有强烈人类主观感受依赖老厂长数十年出海直觉",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 48,
     "startSeconds": 1235.12,
     "endSeconds": 1243.6,
     "textPreview": "找到属于自己的答案感谢大家和我们一起完成今天的深度解析同学们咱们下次见下次见勇敢",
     "canonical": []
    }
   ],
